    "title": "Joe Burrow's Ex-Girlfriend Stuns Fans with Surprise Appearance at NFL Game [PHOTOS] - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Darrelle Lincoln ,\n1 hours ago\nOlivia Holzmacher and Joe Burrow (Photo via Google) Olivia Holzmacher was once the girlfriend of Joe Burrow, who was spotted everywhere with him.\nThen their relationship suddenly took a turn, and she disappeared out of nowhere.\nNFL fans have been feeling bad for Joe Burrow’s former longtime girlfriend since it seems that their blossoming relationship was heading towards the next level, and then it was gone in the blink of an eye.\nHolzmacher and Burrow first met at Ohio State University and began dating in 2017. The one-time college sweethearts broke up, and neither has spoken out about why and how it ended.\nMany fans only found out that Olivia Holzmacher was out of his life when he suddenly started dating model Olivia Ponton. That only came about after Burrow’s Ohio home was broken into while the Bengals were playing the Dallas Cowboys in Texas.\nNow Olivia Holzmacher is back.\nTaking to her Instagram Story, Holzmacher posted a photo from the lower level of Nissan Stadium as she watched the Tennessee Titans lose 30-24 to the Seattle Seahawks on Sunday, according to US Magazine.\nOn the next slide, she showed the sweatshirt, writing over the pic, “LOL grabbed a dark navy crewneck on the way out the door for the Titans game. Ya think my 7th grade boyfriend is still looking for his sweatshirt?”\nThe last time social media heard from Holzmacher, she posted a carousel of pictures in February 2025 showing off what she had been up to.\nMeanwhile, as the Titans were playing their game, Burrow’s Bengals were losing, 26-20, to the New England Patriots. Burrow will finally be back on the field for the team’s Thanksgiving game against the Ravens.\nOlivia Holzmacher Has Been Minding Her Business Olivia Holzmacher (Photo via Instagram) Olivia Holzmacher is not your typical ex-girlfriend of a celebrity or athlete. She was never looking for fame or followers while with him.\nOnce their relationship came to an end at some point in 2024 or sooner, she simply erased all the pictures she had with the Cincinnati Bengals quarterback and disappeared to live her life without the use of social media.\nMost women would immediately start wearing revealing clothes to find another man, but Olivia is much different.\nShe gets genuine love away from social media, and she clearly wouldn’t have it any other way.\nThe post Joe Burrow’s Ex-Girlfriend Stuns Fans with Surprise Appearance at NFL Game [PHOTOS] originally published on Total Pro Sports .",
